title: Organisations of PPS
subtitle: Up to two investments in one action: unions, press, TUR, Milicja or cooperatives.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/workers.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.organizationsAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.organizations (technical reference 13.5; card catalogue 5.1): one or two different
// organisations, at most one package in each, one month and the sum of their R. Nothing is spent before
// the confirmation; a missing R blocks the whole package, never half of it.
PolishParty.organizationsView(Q);
Q.pl_org_pick1 = '';
Q.pl_org_pick2 = '';
!}

= Organisations of PPS

PPS has [+ pl_org_cash +] R. Choose the first investment; a second one for another organisation can follow. The card itself costs one month and waits two months before it comes back.

- @p1_union_organize_industry
- @p1_union_organize_rail
- @p1_union_organize_farm_labour
- @p1_union_fund_industry
- @p1_union_fund_rail
- @p1_union_fund_farm_labour
- @p1_press_distribution
- @p1_tur
- @p1_militia_recruit
- @p1_militia_militarize
- @p1_cooperative_workers
- @p1_cooperative_rural
- @easy_discard

@p1_union_organize_industry
title: Organise the industrial branch
subtitle: 1 R; the branch’s reach +15 with the modifiers of the party’s character and TUR.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.packageStatus(Q, 'union_organize_industry', 0).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_union_organize_industry_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick1 = 'union_organize_industry';
PolishParty.organizationsSecondView(Q, 'union_organize_industry');
!}
go-to: second

