@second
new-page: true

= A second organisation

You may add one investment for another organisation, for the same month. Nothing is spent until you confirm.

- @p2_union_organize_industry
- @p2_union_organize_rail
- @p2_union_organize_farm_labour
- @p2_union_fund_industry
- @p2_union_fund_rail
- @p2_union_fund_farm_labour
- @p2_press_distribution
- @p2_tur
- @p2_militia_recruit
- @p2_militia_militarize
- @p2_cooperative_workers
- @p2_cooperative_rural
- @only_one
- @polish_party_organizations: Choose again from the beginning.

@p2_union_organize_industry
title: Organise the industrial branch
subtitle: 1 R; the branch’s reach +15 with the modifiers of the party’s character and TUR.
choose-if: pl_org2_union_organize_industry_ok = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org2_union_organize_industry_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick2 = 'union_organize_industry';
PolishParty.selectionSummary(Q, [Q.pl_org_pick1, Q.pl_org_pick2]);
!}
go-to: confirm

