on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick2 = '';
PolishParty.selectionSummary(Q, [Q.pl_org_pick1]);
!}
go-to: confirm

@confirm
new-page: true

= Confirm the investment

[+ pl_org_summary +]

- @do_confirm
- @polish_party_organizations: Choose again from the beginning.

@do_confirm
title: Confirm
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.selectionStatus(Q, [Q.pl_org_pick1].concat(Q.pl_org_pick2 ? [Q.pl_org_pick2] : [])).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_confirm_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, [Q.pl_org_pick1].concat(Q.pl_org_pick2 ? [Q.pl_org_pick2] : []));
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Organisations of PPS

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
